外，這些資訊中的大部分都受到方法論方面的考慮或資訊（包括來自第三方的資訊）的影響，這些資訊仍在不斷發展並可能發生變化，且 AMD 不會獨立驗證這些資訊。例如，我們基於任何標準的揭露可能會因框架要求的修訂、資訊的可用性、我們的業務或適用的政府政策的變化或其他因素而發生變化，其中一些因素可能超出我們的控制範圍。"},{"en":"References in this Annual Report on Form 10-K to \"AMD,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" \"management,\" \"our\" or the \"Company\" mean Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. and our consolidated subsidiaries.","zh":"本年度報告 10-K 表格中提及的「AMD」、「我們」、「管理階層」、「我們的」或「本公司」均指 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. 和我們的合併子公司。"},{"en":"AMD drives innovation in high performance and AI computing to solve the world's most important challenges. AMD technology powers billions of experiences across cloud and AI infrastructure, embedded systems, AI PCs and gaming. With a broad portfolio of AI-optimized CPUs, GPUs, networking and software, AMD delivers full-stack solutions that help customers turn data into breakthroughs, with the speed and scale needed for a new era of intelligent computing. Our high-performance product portfolios provide differentiated solutions, including semi-custom System-on-Chip (SoCs), adaptive SoCs and accelerated processing units (APUs). For data centers, we offer AI accelerators, microprocessors (CPUs), graphic processing units (GPUs), data processing units (DPUs), AI Network Interface Cards (AI NICs) and field programmable gate arrays (FPGAs). We offer ultra-low latency networking solutions. We also","zh":"AMD 推動高效能和人工智慧運算領域的創新，以解決世界上最重要的挑戰。 AMD 技術為雲端和 AI 基礎設施、嵌入式系統、AI PC 和遊戲領域的數十億體驗提供支援。憑藉廣泛的 AI 最佳化 CPU、GPU、網路和軟體產品組合，AMD 提供全端解決方案，幫助客戶將資料轉化為突破，並提供智慧運算新時代所需的速度和規模。我們的高效能產品組合提供差異化的解決方案，包括半定製系統單晶片 (SoC)、自適應 SoC 和加速處理單元 (APU)。對於資料中心，我們提供人工智慧加速器、微處理器 (CPU)、圖形處理單元 (GPU)、資料處理單元 (DPU)、人工智慧網路介面卡 (AI NIC) 和現場可程式閘陣列 (FPGA)。我們提供超低延遲網路解決方案。我們也"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We sell our products via a direct sales force, our OEMs (as described in detail below) and through independent distributors and sales representatives in both domestic and international markets. Our sales arrangements generally operate on the basis of product forecasts provided by the particular customer, but do not typically include any commitment or requirement for minimum product purchases. We use purchase orders and related documents, and contractual agreements as evidence of our sales arrangements. Our agreements typically contain standard terms and conditions covering matters such as payment terms, warranties and indemnities for issues specific to our products.","zh":"我們透過直銷隊伍、原始設備製造商（如下文詳細描述）以及國內和國際市場的獨立經銷商和銷售代表銷售我們的產品。我們的銷售安排通常會根據特定客戶提供的產品預測進行操作，但通常不包括任何最低產品採購的承諾或要求。我們使用採購訂單和相關文件以及合約協議作為我們銷售安排的證據。我們的協議通常包含標準條款和條件，涵蓋付款條件、針對我們產品特定問題的保證和賠償等事宜。"},{"en":"We generally warrant that our products sold to our customers will conform to our approved specifications and be free from defects in material and workmanship under normal use and conditions for one year. We offer up to three-year limited warranties for certain product types and sometimes provide other warranty periods based on negotiated terms with certain customers.","zh":"我們一般保證銷售給客戶的產品將符合我們批准的規格，並且在正常使用和條件下一年內不存在材料和工藝缺陷。我們為某些產品類型提供長達三年的有限保修，有時會根據與某些客戶協商的條款提供其他保固期。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The markets in which our products are sold are highly competitive and rapidly evolving and delivering the latest and best products to market on time is critical to revenue growth. The competitiveness of our products depends on a number of factors including, performance, total cost of ownership, timely product introductions, product quality and reliability, product features and capabilities, energy efficiency (including power consumption and battery life, given their impact on total cost of ownership), size (or form factor), selling price, cost, adherence to industry standards (and the creation of open industry standards), level of integration, software and hardware compatibility, ease of use and functionality of software design tools, completeness of applicable software solutions, security and stability, brand recognition and availability. Competition is expected to remain intense, drive","zh":"我們產品銷售的市場競爭激烈且發展迅速，按時向市場提供最新、最好的產品對於收入成長至關重要。我們產品的競爭力取決於多種因素，包括性能、總擁有成本、及時推出產品、產品品質和可靠性、產品特性和功能、能源效率（包括功耗和電池壽命，考慮到它們對總擁有成本的影響）、尺寸（或外形尺寸）、售價、成本、遵守行業標準（以及開放行業標準的創建）、集成水平、軟體和兼容性、軟體設計工具的可用性和功能性、功能性、功能性、功能性、功能性和安全性、功能性、軟體設計工具和安全性、軟體設計工具的安全性和安全性和安全性。預計競爭仍將激烈，推動"},{"en":"In the Data Center segment, we compete primarily against Intel Corporation (Intel) and Nvidia Corporation (Nvidia with our CPU, GPU DPU and AI NIC server products. In addition, we compete against Altera with our FPGA and adaptive SoC server products. A variety of smaller fabless silicon companies offer proprietary accelerator solutions and Arm -based CPUs targeting data center use cases. In addition, some of our customers are internally developing their own data center microprocessor products and accelerator products which could impact the available market for our products.","zh":"在資料中心領域，我們主要透過 CPU、GPU DPU 和 AI NIC 伺服器產品與英特爾公司 (Intel) 和 Nvidia 公司 (Nvidia) 競爭。此外，我們也透過 FPGA 和自適應 SoC 伺服器產品與 Altera 競爭。各種小型無晶圓廠矽公司提供針對資料中心用例的專有加速器解決方案和基於 Arm 的 CPU。此外，我們的一些客戶正在內部開發自己的資料中心微處理器產品和加速器產品，這可能會影響我們產品的可用市場。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-27","items":[{"name":"Datacenter","val":16635000000,"zh":"資料中心"},{"name":"Client & Gaming","val":14550000000,"zh":"客戶端與遊戲"},{"name":"Embedded","val":3454000000,"zh":"嵌入式"}],"total":34639000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-27","items":[{"name":"US","val":11363000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CN","val":7751000000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":6055000000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"TW","val":5186000000,"zh":"台灣"},{"name":"SG","val":4284000000,"zh":"新加坡"}],"total":34639000000}},"peers":["INTC","MU","NFLX","PLTR","TSM"]}}